This file is what was left in C:\WINDOWS\TEMP after a word processor closed
badly in about 1996, and it never went away, because nothing deleted the
Temp folder and nobody dared to.

A real one would be a few kilobytes of a document you had already saved,
written in a format nothing could read back, with the name of the machine
somewhere in the middle of it and a date that made no sense.

This one is a text file pretending to be that, which makes it the most
honest thing in the folder.

You may delete it. Nothing will happen, in either direction: the system does
not read this drive, and the file is in a repository, so it will be back
tomorrow.
